 "_notes": {
  "bahrain-grand-prix-bh": "The 2026 Bahrain Grand Prix was NOT held at Sakhir/Bahrain International Circuit as the record's place/coordinates imply. After the April 2026 race was postponed due to regional conflict, it was reinstated as an away race at Sepang International Circuit in Malaysia (Oct 2-4, 2026), keeping the 'Bahrain Grand Prix' name/sponsorship but not the location. Dates in the record (2026-10-02 to 2026-10-04) match the rescheduled race, but place='Sakhir'/country='Bahrain' and the lat/lng (Bahrain International Circuit) are wrong for this edition; it should point to Sepang, Malaysia for 2026. Sources: https://www.skysports.com/f1/news/13566600/malaysia-added-to-2026-f1-calendar-in-october-to-host-postponed-bahrain-gp-amid-continued-conflict-in-middle-east , https://www.espn.com/f1/story/_/id/49453371/formula-1-bahrain-grand-prix-malaysia-new-race-confirmed-f1-2026-schedule-changes . Note the 2027 Bahrain GP (Mar 12-14) and Saudi Arabian GP (Mar 19-21, matches record) both return to their normal Gulf venues, so this is a 2026-only anomaly."
 }
}